    "long_instructions": "# Fixing Buggy Code\r\n\r\n1. **Test the Bug:** Run the app. Click **Filter: Nut-Free**, then click **Reset Data**. Notice that the \"Nut\" items are lost forever because the global data was permanently overwritten by the filter function.\r\n\r\n2. **Refactor for Purity:** Use AI to update the `filterNutFree()` function so it returns the new filtered list instead of mutating existing lists. Then, update the button's event listener to capture that returned value and pass it to `renderMenu().`\r\n\r\n3. **Render:** Test out your updated code again. Clicking Reset Data should now correctly show the full menu because the global `bakedGoods` list was never changed.",
